      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_4febda18",
      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: meme_image; hasOverallIntent: Mysogynous; overall-intent-description: The image depicts three men laughing while holding cups, with text overlaid that reads: 'you think that hoe thinks you're special' and 'lol she says that to us too!'. The term 'hoe' is a derogatory slang term used to demean women, implying they are sexually promiscuous and unworthy of respect. The meme uses this language to mock the idea that a woman might be attracted to or value a man, suggesting that such a belief is foolish or laughable. This reflects a misogynistic attitude by reducing a woman's worth to her sexual behavior and mocking her perceived lack of discernment. The overall intent is to ridicule and belittle women through the use of sexist language, fitting under the 'Mysogynous' category as it contains hate against women.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_506e9b36"
      },
      "extractionMethod": "llm_extraction_huggingface"
    },
